  lines:
  - character: {fileID: 0}
    speakerNameOverride: Aris
    dialogueText: Langsung ke intinya saja. Aku mendengar percakapanmu dengan Gita
      di koridor tadi.
    isThought: 0
    expression: 
    backgroundOverride: {fileID: 0}
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolume: 1
    conditionKey: gita_offer
    conditionValue: menerima
    minigameSceneName: 
    stageCommands: []
    choices: []
  - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3b5617a48f58d8c4ca468e81a8bb0bd6, type: 2}
    speakerNameOverride: Tono
    dialogueText: (Glek.. dia tahu kejadian di koridor secepat ini?)
    isThought: 0
    expression: 
    backgroundOverride: {fileID: 0}
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolume: 1
    conditionKey: 
    conditionValue: 
    minigameSceneName: 
    stageCommands: []
    choices: []
  - character: {fileID: 0}
    speakerNameOverride: Aris
    dialogueText: ' Lebih tepatnya, aku dapat laporan'
    isThought: 0
    expression: 
    backgroundOverride: {fileID: 0}
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolume: 1
    conditionKey: 
    conditionValue: 
    minigameSceneName: 
    stageCommands: []
    choices: []
  - character: {fileID: 0}
    speakerNameOverride: Aris
    dialogueText: Dan dari laporan yang kudapat, kamu memilih bersekutu dengan Gita
      untuk bisnis busuk mereka di kantin.
    isThought: 0
    expression: 
    backgroundOverride: {fileID: 0}
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolume: 1
    conditionKey: 
    conditionValue: 
    minigameSceneName: 
    stageCommands: []
    choices: []
  - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3b5617a48f58d8c4ca468e81a8bb0bd6, type: 2}
    speakerNameOverride: Tono
    dialogueText: ...
    isThought: 0
    expression: 
    backgroundOverride: {fileID: 0}
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolume: 1
    conditionKey: 
    conditionValue: 
    minigameSceneName: 
    stageCommands: []
    choices: []
  - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3b5617a48f58d8c4ca468e81a8bb0bd6, type: 2}
    speakerNameOverride: Tono
    dialogueText: Aku cuma butuh jaminan agar Rico dan gengnya tidak menggangguku.
      Gita menawarkan perlindungan itu.
    isThought: 0
    expression: 
    backgroundOverride: {fileID: 0}
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolume: 1
    conditionKey: 
    conditionValue: 
    minigameSceneName: 
    stageCommands: []
    choices: []
  - character: {fileID: 0}
    speakerNameOverride: Aris
    dialogueText: Memilih perlindungan dari sekelompok kriminal sekolah? Keputusan
      yang sangat amat ceroboh, Tono.
    isThought: 0
    expression: 
    backgroundOverride: {fileID: 0}
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolume: 1
    conditionKey: 
    conditionValue: 
    minigameSceneName: 
    stageCommands: []
    choices: []
  - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3b5617a48f58d8c4ca468e81a8bb0bd6, type: 2}
    speakerNameOverride: Tono
    dialogueText: (Kamu juga tidak jauh dari kata kriminal, Aris)
    isThought: 0
    expression: 
    backgroundOverride: {fileID: 0}
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolume: 1
    conditionKey: 
    conditionValue: 
    minigameSceneName: 
    stageCommands: []
    choices: []
  - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3b5617a48f58d8c4ca468e81a8bb0bd6, type: 2}
    speakerNameOverride: Tono
    dialogueText: Maksudmu?
    isThought: 0
    expression: 
    backgroundOverride: {fileID: 0}
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolume: 1
    conditionKey: 
    conditionValue: 
    minigameSceneName: 
    stageCommands: []
    choices: []
  - character: {fileID: 0}
    speakerNameOverride: Aris
    dialogueText: Aku tadinya mau menawarkan perlindungan resmi dari OSIS. Tapi karena
      kamu memilih bersekutu dengan faksi Kantin, aku tidak bisa membantumu lagi.
    isThought: 0
    expression: 
    backgroundOverride: {fileID: 0}
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolume: 1
    conditionKey: 
    conditionValue: 
    minigameSceneName: 
    stageCommands: []
    choices: []
  - character: {fileID: 0}
    speakerNameOverride: Aris
    dialogueText: "Jangan menyalahkanku kalau namamu terseret saat OSIS menertibkan
      kalian nanti. Selamat menikmati \u2018perlindunganmu\u2019 "
    isThought: 0
    expression: 
    backgroundOverride: {fileID: 0}
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolume: 1
    conditionKey: 
    conditionValue: 
    minigameSceneName: 
    stageCommands: []
    choices: []
  - character: {fileID: 0}
    speakerNameOverride: 
    dialogueText: Fade out. Kedua sprite hilang
    isThought: 0
    expression: 
    backgroundOverride: {fileID: 0}
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolume: 1
    conditionKey: 
    conditionValue: 
    minigameSceneName: 
    stageCommands: []
    choices: []
  - character: {fileID: 0}
    speakerNameOverride: 
    dialogueText: // Tono keluar dari ruangan OSIS.
    isThought: 0
    expression: 
    backgroundOverride: {fileID: 0}
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolume: 1
    conditionKey: 
    conditionValue: 
    minigameSceneName: 
    stageCommands: []
    choices: []
  - character: {fileID: 0}
    speakerNameOverride: 
    dialogueText: Isi pikirannya bercampur aduk //
    isThought: 0
    expression: 
    backgroundOverride: {fileID: 0}
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolume: 1
    conditionKey: 
    conditionValue: 
    minigameSceneName: 
    stageCommands: []
    choices: []
  - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3b5617a48f58d8c4ca468e81a8bb0bd6, type: 2}
    speakerNameOverride: Tono
    dialogueText: ( Entah mengapa, ancamannya terasa sangat menakutkan )
